2
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:08,440
Well, everybody, welcome to Amazing Discovery.
好了，大家好，歡迎收看《驚奇發現》。

3
00:00:09,700 --> 00:00:11,040
Oh, oh, it's on again.
啊啊啊又開始了

4
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:13,240
You guys, could you please not watch this?
各位，能不能別看這個？

5
00:00:14,760 --> 00:00:16,160
Folks, has this ever happened to you?
親們，你們有遇過這樣的情況嗎？

6
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,300
You go to the refrigerator to get a nice glass of milk,
你去冰箱拿一杯好喝的牛奶，

7
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:21,680
but these darn cartons are so flingin' flangin' hard to open.
但這些該死的紙箱實在太難開啟了。

8
00:00:21,960 --> 00:00:23,040
Well, you said it, Mike.
好吧，你說的是，麥克。

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,720
There's gotta be a better way.
一定有更好的辦法。

10
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:28,980
And there is, Kevin.
還有，凱文。

11
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:31,540
Could you please turn this off?
你能把這個關掉嗎？

12
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,100
No way, Kevin.
沒辦法，凱文。

13
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:37,460
There's a revolutionary new product that guarantees
有一個革命性的新產品可以保證

14
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:40,440
you'll never have to open up milk cartons again.
您再也不用開啟牛奶盒了。

15
00:00:40,900 --> 00:00:43,060
Meet the Milk Master 2000.
來認識一下牛奶大師 2000。

16
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:45,960
Are you intrigued?
你有興趣嗎？

17
00:00:46,400 --> 00:00:48,060
You're flingin' flangin' right, I am.
你說得對，我也是。

18
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:51,540
This is the first time he's never used this product before.
這是他第一次使用這個產品。

19
00:00:51,580 --> 00:00:53,120
You're gonna see how easy this is to do.
您將會看到這是多麼容易做到的。

20
00:00:53,340 --> 00:00:53,680
Go ahead.
前進。

21
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:56,300
This works in any milk carton.
這適用於任何牛奶盒。

22
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,480
Wow, it is easy.
哇，這很容易。

23
00:00:57,920 --> 00:01:00,400
Now I can have milk every day.
現在我可以每天喝牛奶了。

24
00:01:02,940 --> 00:01:04,300
I can't watch this anymore.
我不能再看這個了

25
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,480
Oh, all right, you've suffered enough.
哦，好吧，你已經受夠了。

26
00:01:06,640 --> 00:01:07,600
We'll change it, we'll change it.
我們會改變它，我們會改變它。

27
00:01:08,220 --> 00:01:09,960
How many times has this happened to you?
這種情況在你身上發生過幾次？

28
00:01:11,840 --> 00:01:13,300
There's gotta be a better way.
一定有更好的辦法。

29
00:01:27,480 --> 00:01:28,700
It's a joke you broke.
這是一個你打破的笑話。

30
00:01:28,980 --> 00:01:30,340
Love lost its way.
愛情迷失了方向。

31
00:01:31,580 --> 00:01:35,340
It's like you're always stuck in second gear.
就像你總是被困在二檔一樣。

32
00:01:35,920 --> 00:01:39,360
When it hasn't been your day, your week, your month,
當這不是你的一天、你的一週、你的一個月時，

33
00:01:39,620 --> 00:01:40,820
or even your year.
甚至是你的年份。

34
00:01:41,420 --> 00:01:44,540
But I'll be there for you.
但我會在你身邊。

35
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,920
When the rain starts to pour.
當雨開始傾盆而下。

36
00:01:47,020 --> 00:01:49,480
I'll be there for you.
我會在那等你。

37
00:01:50,060 --> 00:01:51,880
Like I've been there before.
就像我以前去過那裡一樣。

38
00:01:52,020 --> 00:01:54,880
I'll be there for you.
我會在那等你。

39
00:01:54,880 --> 00:01:57,160
Because you're there for me too
因為你也在我身邊

40
00:02:04,220 --> 00:02:06,400
It's official, there are no good movies.
這是官方的，沒有好電影。

41
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:09,440
So let's go to a bad one and make out.
那我們就來看看壞事吧。

42
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:10,680
Ha ha ha ha!
哈哈哈哈！

43
00:02:13,720 --> 00:02:17,420
Perhaps you would like me to turn like this, so you can bunny bump against my back.
也許你希望我像這樣轉動，這樣你就可以兔子撞到我的背上。

44
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:20,580
Hey!
嘿！

45
00:02:20,820 --> 00:02:21,200
Hey!
嘿！

46
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,620
Hey man! What's up?
嘿夥計！這是怎麼回事？

47
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,180
Maybe you can tell me.
也許你可以告訴我。

48
00:02:24,380 --> 00:02:28,180
My agent would like to know why I didn't show up at the audition I didn't know I had today.
我的經紀人想知道為什麼我沒有出現在我今天不知道的試鏡中。

49
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,160
The first good thing she gets me in weeks.
這是她幾週來帶給我的第一件好事。

50
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:31,360
How could you not give me the message?
你怎麼能不給我訊息呢？

51
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,860
I'll tell you, I do enjoy guilt.
我告訴你，我確實喜歡內疚。

52
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:37,160
But, uh, it wasn't me.
但是，呃，那不是我。

53
00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:38,900
Yes it was, it was him, uh-huh.
是的，就是他，嗯哼。

54
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,320
Okay, it was me.
好吧，是我。

55
00:02:44,660 --> 00:02:45,440
How was it you?
你怎麼樣？

56
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:47,920
Well, it was just, it was all so crazy, you know?
好吧，這一切都太瘋狂了，你知道嗎？

57
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:51,440
I mean, Chandler was in the closet counting to ten and he was up to seven
我的意思是，錢德勒在衣櫃裡數到十，而他數到了七

58
00:02:51,440 --> 00:02:53,260
and I hadn't found a place to hide yet.
而我還沒找到躲藏的地方。

59
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:58,420
I, I meant to tell you and I wrote it all down on my hand, see? All of it.
我，我本來想告訴你的，我都寫在手上了，懂嗎？所有這一切。

60
00:02:59,820 --> 00:03:00,940
Yep, that's my audition.
是的，這就是我的試鏡。

61
00:03:01,900 --> 00:03:04,540
See? Now this is why I keep notepads everywhere.
看？這就是為什麼我到處放記事本的原因。

62
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,760
Yep, and that's why we don't invite you to play.
是的，這就是我們不邀請你玩的原因。

63
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:12,280
What is the great tragedy here? You go get yourself another appointment.
這裡最大的悲劇是什麼？你去給自己另一個約會。

64
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:14,280
Well, Estelle tried, you know?
嗯，埃斯特爾嘗試過，你知道嗎？

65
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:16,800
The casting director told her I missed my chance.
選角導演告訴她我錯過了機會。

66
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,160
Well, that is unfair.
嗯，這是不公平的。

67
00:03:18,580 --> 00:03:20,840
I'll call her, I'll tell her it was totally my fault.
我會打電話給她，我會告訴她這完全是我的錯。

68
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:25,380
Sheesh, you can't do that. The casting director doesn't talk to friends, she only talks to agents.
希什，你不能這麼做。選角導演不與朋友交談，她只與經紀人交談。

69
00:03:25,620 --> 00:03:27,380
What a sad little life she must lead.
她必須過著多麼悲傷的小生活。

70
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:30,320
Okay, ooh.
好吧，哦。

71
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:32,400
What are you doing? What are you doing?
你在幹什麼？你在幹什麼？

72
00:03:32,520 --> 00:03:33,780
No, no, no, I know, I know, ooh.
不不不，我知道，我知道，哦。

73
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:38,040
Hi, this is Caitlin from Phoebe Buffay's office.
大家好，我是菲比·布菲辦公室的凱特琳。

74
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:42,580
Um, is, um, Anne there? For Phoebe?
嗯，嗯，安妮在嗎？為了菲比？

75
00:03:42,960 --> 00:03:44,120
She'll know what it's about.
她會知道這是關於什麼的。

76
00:03:45,280 --> 00:03:46,260
Hang on, hang on for a second.
等一下，等一下。

77
00:03:49,340 --> 00:03:50,060
Anne, hot.
安妮，熱。

78
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:52,520
Listen, we've got a problem with Joey Tribbiani.
聽著，我們和喬伊·崔比亞尼之間有一個問題。

79
00:03:52,740 --> 00:03:54,060
Apparently he missed his audition.
顯然他錯過了試鏡。

80
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:55,900
Who did you speak to in my office?
你在我辦公室和誰說話？

81
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,160
Estelle? No, I don't know what I'm going to do with her.
埃斯特爾？不，我不知道我要對她做什麼。

82
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:01,460
No, alright, so your husband leaves you and then burns down the apartment.
不，好吧，所以你的丈夫離開了你，然後燒毀了公寓。

83
00:04:01,580 --> 00:04:02,480
The world does not stop.
世界並沒有停止。

84
00:04:04,080 --> 00:04:05,320
Is anybody else scared?
還有人害怕嗎？

85
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:10,560
Right, well look, if Joey loses this audition, then that is it for Estelle.
好吧，好吧，如果喬伊輸掉了這次試鏡，那麼艾斯特爾也就結束了。

86
00:04:10,580 --> 00:04:11,200
I don't care.
我不在乎。

87
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,560
Anne, you are a doll.
安妮，你是個洋娃娃。

88
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:15,160
What time can you see him?
你什麼時候能見到他？

89
00:04:15,160 --> 00:04:15,760
I need a pad.
我需要一個墊子。

90
00:04:22,400 --> 00:04:24,800
Get the woman a pad, get the woman a pad.
給女人一個護墊，給女人一個護墊。

91
00:04:24,900 --> 00:04:25,760
A pad, a pad.
一個墊子，一個墊子。

92
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:28,980
Oh, now you want a pad.
哦，現在你想要一個墊子。

93
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:38,060
Huh, well that's funny.
嗯，這很有趣。

94
00:04:38,400 --> 00:04:41,480
Ugly naked guy's still naked, but his dog's wearing a sweater.
醜陋的裸體傢伙仍然赤身裸體，但他的狗穿著一件毛衣。

95
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:45,700
Hey.
嘿。

96
00:04:47,020 --> 00:04:48,780
Here's my boy.
這是我的男孩。

97
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,840
Here's my boy.
這是我的男孩。

98
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:53,760
And here's his Barbie.
這是他的芭比娃娃。

99
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,940
What's, uh, what's my boy doing with the Barbie?
呃，我的兒子在拿芭比娃娃做什麼？

100
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:05,320
He picked it out at the toy store himself.
他自己在玩具店挑選的。

101
00:05:05,460 --> 00:05:06,300
He loves it.
他喜歡它。

102
00:05:06,420 --> 00:05:08,640
He carries it everywhere, it's like a security blanket.
他到處都帶著它，它就像一條安全毯。

103
00:05:09,140 --> 00:05:11,020
But with ski boots and a kicky beret.
但搭配滑雪靴和漂亮的貝雷帽。

104
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:14,540
Yeah, it's, it's, it's cute.
是的，這，這，這很可愛。

105
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:17,620
Why, why, why does he have it again?
為什麼，為什麼，為什麼他又擁有了？

106
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,080
So it's got a doll, so what?
所以它有一個娃娃，那又怎樣？

107
00:05:22,220 --> 00:05:27,540
Unless you're afraid he's gonna grow up to be in show business.
除非你擔心他長大後會進入演藝界。

108
00:05:27,900 --> 00:05:31,460
That's what it had to do with the fact that he's been raised by two women, wouldn't it?
這就是因為他是由兩個女人撫養長大的，不是嗎？

109
00:05:33,500 --> 00:05:34,840
You know what, it's fine.
你知道嗎，沒關係。

110
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:38,120
If you're okay with the Barbie thing, so am I.
如果你對芭比娃娃感到滿意，我也同意。

111
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,720
Give daddy the Barbie.
把芭比娃娃送給爸爸。

112
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,000
Give me the Barbie.
把芭比娃娃給我。

113
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:44,460
Okay, how about, don't you want to play with a momster truck?
好吧，怎麼樣，你不想和媽媽卡車一起玩嗎？

114
00:05:47,220 --> 00:05:50,880
Okay, how about a dino soldier?
好吧，恐龍士兵怎麼樣？

115
00:05:56,380 --> 00:05:58,260
Ross, you are so pathetic.
羅斯，你真是太可憐了。

116
00:05:58,500 --> 00:06:00,600
Why can't your son just play with his doll?
為什麼你的兒子不能玩他的洋娃娃？

117
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:08,960
I gotta go to work.
我得去上班了。

118
00:06:11,260 --> 00:06:12,920
Has anybody seen my left boob?
有人看到我的左胸了嗎？

119
00:06:14,820 --> 00:06:16,080
I love that movie.
我喜歡那部電影。

120
00:06:20,860 --> 00:06:22,740
It is? Joey, what are you doing?
這是？喬伊，你在做什麼？

121
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:25,380
I'm sorry, it just felt nice.
抱歉，只是感覺很好。

122
00:06:28,120 --> 00:06:30,320
Joey, Joey, answer the phone.
喬伊，喬伊，接電話。

123
00:06:31,100 --> 00:06:33,920
Hey, I only got one good arm, you know, you should be doing stuff for me.
嘿，我只有一隻好手臂，你知道，你應該為我做點什麼。

124
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:34,720
Go get me a sweater.
去買一件毛衣給我。

125
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:39,760
Just do it, okay? It's Janice, and if I get it, I'm gonna have to see her tonight.
就做吧，好嗎？我是珍妮絲，如果我找到了，我今晚就得去見她。

126
00:06:42,620 --> 00:06:44,800
Oh, that's great. I'm gonna have to see her tonight.
哦，那太好了。今晚我要去見她。

127
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:47,520
What's the big deal? Why don't you want to see Janice?
有什麼大不了的？為什麼不想見珍妮絲？

128
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:50,200
Okay, last night at dinner, when the meals came,
好吧 昨晚吃飯的時候 飯菜上來的時候

129
00:06:50,460 --> 00:06:53,840
she put half her chicken piccata on my plate, and then she took all my tomatoes.
她把一半的雞肉皮卡塔放在我的盤子裡，然後她拿走了我所有的番茄。

130
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:01,060
That's bad because you hate chicken piccata?
這很糟糕，因為你討厭雞肉皮卡塔？

131
00:07:02,180 --> 00:07:02,580
No.
不。

132
00:07:03,400 --> 00:07:05,120
You didn't want to share your tomatoes.
你不想分享你的西紅柿。

133
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,620
Tomatoes are very important to you.
西紅柿對你來說非常重要。

134
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:10,740
No, it's like all of a sudden we were this couple, okay?
不，就像突然間我們就成為了這對情侶，好嗎？

135
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:12,980
And this alarm started going off in my head, you know?
這個警報開始在我的腦海中響起，你知道嗎？

136
00:07:13,320 --> 00:07:14,620
Run for your life! Get out of the building!
為你的生命奔跑！離開大樓！

137
00:07:17,340 --> 00:07:18,580
Men are unbelievable.
男人是難以置信的。

138
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,980
Janice just thought she was giving you chicken.
珍妮絲只是以為她在給你雞肉。

139
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,260
She didn't think she was giving you scary chicken.
她不認為她給了你可怕的雞肉。

140
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:26,340
What is it with you people?
你們怎麼了？

141
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:29,960
I mean, the minute you start to feel something, you have to run away?
我是說，一旦你開始感覺到什麼，就必須逃跑？

142
00:07:30,140 --> 00:07:31,940
I know, that...
我知道，那...

143
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,040
That's why I don't want to go tonight.
這就是為什麼我今晚不想去。

144
00:07:35,100 --> 00:07:37,700
I'm afraid I'm gonna say something stupid.
我怕我會說些蠢話。

145
00:07:37,700 --> 00:07:41,200
Oh, you mean like that guy thing where you act all mean and distant
哦，你的意思是像那個傢伙那樣，你表現得很卑鄙和疏遠

146
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:42,720
until you get us to break up with you?
直到你讓我們跟你分手？

147
00:07:43,320 --> 00:07:44,660
Hey, you know about that?
嘿，你知道嗎？

148
00:07:46,460 --> 00:07:48,500
What do I do? I want to get past this.
我該怎麼辦？我想克服這個。

149
00:07:48,600 --> 00:07:50,560
I don't want to be afraid of the commitment thing.
我不想害怕承諾的事。

150
00:07:50,980 --> 00:07:53,500
I want to go through the tunnel to the other side.
我想穿過隧道到另一邊。

151
00:07:55,320 --> 00:07:57,280
Where there's no fear of commitment.
那裡不用擔心承諾。

152
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,120
Do we have any...
我們有沒有什麼...

153
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:06,460
Do we have any thoughts here?
說到這裡我們有什麼想法嗎？

154
00:08:07,120 --> 00:08:08,760
Well, I've never been through the tunnel myself
好吧，我自己從來沒有穿過隧道

155
00:08:08,760 --> 00:08:10,820
because, as I understand it, you're not allowed to go through
因為據我瞭解，你不被允許透過

156
00:08:10,820 --> 00:08:12,180
with more than one girl in the car, right?
車上不只一個女孩，對嗎？

157
00:08:15,540 --> 00:08:18,480
